  "OPEN on this stage \u2014 the property has no instance: nothing today can refuse from outside the model.\nCI on ~/3of3 is the first concrete build item (MVP sequence). Until it exists, every gate on this page\nis prompt-layer \u2014 the escalation contract is written but not enforceable.",
